#25450
Atop the tower~
You are at the top of a set of polished wooden stairs, on a circular marble
platform on top of the great iron tower of Dis.  Directly above you, a ball on
top a spire is drawing many lightning bolts from the roiling clouds, and arcs
of lightning constantly travel down the spire and into the surface of the tower
itself.  Slightly below you, you can see the crennelations of the outer tower,
and the portal platform extending out from the edge of the tower to the
northwest.  The only exit is down, into the Hall of Dispater.
~
